*
!private/
!public/
!.gitignore
# The learner-facing frontend template (StaticSiteBuilder injects CMS data
# into this at request time for /site/{token} and the static export ZIP).
# Unlike private/public (per-request runtime storage), this is source code
# that should be reviewable/diffable like any other template.
!static-template/
!static-template/**
static-template/artifacts/~$*
